  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 601.02 Duty of Licensees Regarding Scope of Practice. Each licensee shall practice only within the scope of his or her training, expertise, and capability.\n\nSource. #7081, eff 8-26-99; ss by #7872, eff 4-14-03; ss by #10004, INTERIM, eff 9-22-11, EXPIRED: 3-20-12\n\nNew. #10158, eff 6-27-12; ss by #13516-A, eff 3-7-23",
